{"3045180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sleep Herd", "steam_appid": 3045180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Explore, collect, fight, and light your way through a dark and dreamy wonderland in this 2-4 player resource management campaign!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/641f818be2ba0e1c881b3549fe146ddb.poster.avif?t=1785350302\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/641f818be2ba0e1c881b3549fe146ddb.webm?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/641f818be2ba0e1c881b3549fe146ddb.mp4?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beyond mellow pastures and brambly woods is the Dreamland: a labyrinth of vague memories shrouded in mysterious familiarity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the fantastical story of four cutely crafted dolls: the willful <strong>Beep</strong>, dozy <strong>Kovsky</strong>, dutiful <strong>Tchai</strong>, and fashionable <strong>Bo</strong>. Guide a flock of curious sheep spirits who seem eager to help as you encounter halls of obstacles, nooks of secrets, and less-than-friendly dwellers in the shadows.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/8b6f318036165d0a7021a34fbb5d8481.poster.avif?t=1785350302\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/8b6f318036165d0a7021a34fbb5d8481.webm?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/8b6f318036165d0a7021a34fbb5d8481.mp4?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/8a78ca2a38f5ed815a5d72fad1463507.avif?t=1785350302\" alt=\"GRAB\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras_big/8a78ca2a38f5ed815a5d72fad1463507.webp?t=1785350302 width=1600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/d6e4bf76ed17f0bfecd60aba032881ce.avif?t=1785350302\" alt=\"THROW\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras_big/d6e4bf76ed17f0bfecd60aba032881ce.webp?t=1785350302 width=1600 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/e2ecbe1f4b3abfdec46dc13f3613a75c.avif?t=1785350302\" alt=\"PARADE\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras_big/e2ecbe1f4b3abfdec46dc13f3613a75c.webp?t=1785350302 width=1600 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the darkness while you race against the clock! Master the map while you discover its tales! Coordinate with your team to boost your memento score! A magical fantasia awaits you and your friends </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/7a1cc893ab6ef07bc1839db1d7aae885.poster.avif?t=1785350302\" width=1170 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/7a1cc893ab6ef07bc1839db1d7aae885.webm?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/7a1cc893ab6ef07bc1839db1d7aae885.mp4?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a winding manor and an upbeat patisserie world in the first two chapters of act one, with a total of six chapters across three acts. Wrangle wild sheep roaming these worlds with your guiding light and command them in a parade of spirits to carry items, tear down barriers, solve cooperative puzzles, and keep predators at bay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/38bce4728ef4876ad1a397b8c583a93f.poster.avif?t=1785350302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/38bce4728ef4876ad1a397b8c583a93f.webm?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/38bce4728ef4876ad1a397b8c583a93f.mp4?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the landscape of the Dreamland are supplies for your fire, items to enhance your playstyle, and mementos of forgotten memories. Uncover the reality of the dream by gathering these mementos at the hearth, all while strengthening your herd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/4732bc0c65e3b5f2c1e9f3d141bed591.poster.avif?t=1785350302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/4732bc0c65e3b5f2c1e9f3d141bed591.webm?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/4732bc0c65e3b5f2c1e9f3d141bed591.mp4?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your light will slowly trickle away but so will the light of the hearth! Keep an eye on both while also organizing your sheep. Split up to cover more ground or stick close to work together as you venture deeper into the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/8398d7b4e75af636006563fe058ff58e.poster.avif?t=1785350302\" width=856 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/8398d7b4e75af636006563fe058ff58e.webm?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/8398d7b4e75af636006563fe058ff58e.mp4?t=1785350302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras/a2c6a15e192f7b0f85b2375ace166fd2.avif?t=1785350302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045180/extras_big/a2c6a15e192f7b0f85b2375ace166fd2.avif?t=1785350302 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHEPHERD YOUR DREAMS!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four characters with unique persona